* ============================================================================
* 19_bs_num_intensity_robustness.do — v3.5.1 A3 Numerical Intensity (benefit_society Table A8)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Anchor: Davis & Tama-Sweet (2012, CAR 29:3); 公式项目自定义 (原引 Hales 2011 系误归, 见 numerical_intensity docstring); 真双轨 (修 R3-C2).
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear
set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* fix(omni-gapfill-17, 2026-06-12): (i) Panel A 双轨拆为各自单轨回归 — 项目纪律
* (用户钦定): 双轨互为稳健性, 两轨分别进各自回归、不同进一 RHS (高相关双轨同列
* 致两个 β 共线不可解释); (ii) vce(cluster bank_id year) → vce(cluster bank_id):
* 本篇 11b 头注红线 G_year=2 不可按 year 聚类 (T≥30 解禁), 对齐 11-14 全部单维
* 聚类; (iii) DV 统一 {{MAIN_DV}}_w (winsorized, 全篇其余表同口径); (iv) ctx 列
* 补 capture confirm 守卫; (v) esttab 名单动态化 (守卫跳过后硬点名 → r(111))。

* Panel A: 量化披露强度 (数字密度公式, 项目自定义; Davis-Tama-Sweet 2012 CAR;
* 原引 Hales 系误归; 真双轨 — full / ctx 各自单轨一列)
capture confirm variable mean_num_intensity_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w mean_num_intensity_full $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    eststo bs_numint_full
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] mean_num_intensity_full not in panel"
}
capture confirm variable mean_num_intensity_ctx
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w mean_num_intensity_ctx $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    eststo bs_numint_ctx
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] mean_num_intensity_ctx not in panel"
}

* Panel B: 与 LLM substance 交互 (discriminant: 量化披露 ↔ 实质性; full 轨)
capture confirm variable mean_num_intensity_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w c.mean_num_intensity_full##c.{{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    eststo bs_numint_interact
}

qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local models ""
foreach m in bs_numint_full bs_numint_ctx bs_numint_interact {
    if `: list m in stored' local models `models' `m'
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] Table A8 无任何已存储估计 (num_intensity 列全缺); 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/tableA8_num_intensity.tex", ///
        se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) replace ///
        title("Table A8: Numerical Intensity Robustness — {{PAPER_ID}}") ///
        note("Dual-track independent regex+cn2arab scan; full/ctx in separate columns (mutual-robustness discipline). Chinese sentence denominator caveat per paper §3.4. SE clustered at bank_id (G_year=2 forbids year clustering, cf. 11b).")
}
